# Expo / RN Conventions

- This is **Expo SDK 54** (React Native 0.81, React 19). APIs have changed across
  SDK versions — when unsure, check https://docs.expo.dev/versions/v54.0.0/ rather
  than trusting memory.
- **Deliberately pinned to SDK 54 — do not upgrade.** The App Store version of
  Expo Go only supports SDK 54 (newer Expo Go builds are stuck in Apple review,
  as of mid-2026), and the user tests on a physical iPhone via Expo Go. Revisit
  only when Expo Go updates or we switch to a dev build.
- Package manager is **bun** (`bun.lock`). Add native/Expo dependencies with
  `bunx expo install <pkg>` (never bare `bun add`) so versions match the SDK.
  Pure-JS libs (zustand) via `bun add` are fine.
- TypeScript strict mode is on; keep it clean. Run `bun run typecheck` after changes.
- Audio: `expo-audio` (not the removed `expo-av`). Haptics: `expo-haptics`.
  Persistence: `@react-native-async-storage/async-storage`.
- Test on a real device via Expo Go / dev build early — animation feel and haptics
  cannot be judged in a simulator.
